offer words of support. The Web site evolved into CarePages, a business that
the Langshurs launched to help other caregivers in a similar situation. The
Langshurs’ story is interesting and is one that anyone can relate to. It might
even cause the person reading the plan to pause and think, “I remember when
my dad was in the hospital and was so sick—everyone wanted to know how he
was doing. I wish we'd had access to a product like CarePages back then.”

