articulate its purpose clearly and distinctly. The products and services section
should include an explanation of your product or service, beyond what is
written in the executive summary. Include a description of how your product or
service is unique and how you plan to position it in the marketplace. A product
or service’s position is how it is situated relative to its rivals. If you plan to open
a new type of smoothie shop, for example, you should explain how your
